th shelter\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"Beach 3 – beach sitting platforms\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 1 – boardwalk with surprise view\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 8,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 2 – boardwalk with sitting and viewing platform\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 9,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 3 – winding boardwalk with seating\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"least_favourite\",\n      \"title\": \"Please assess which of the designs is your least favourite.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Cliff 1 – viewing platform\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Cliff 2 – stepped sitting structure\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Cliff 3 – stepped sitting structure with water access\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"Beach 1 – boardwalk and enclosed swimming platform\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"Beach 2 – platform with shelter\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"Beach 3 – beach sitting platforms\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 1 – boardwalk with surprise view\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 8,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 2 – boardwalk with sitting and viewing platform\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 9,\n        \"text\": \"Reed 3 – winding boardwalk with seating\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"ins\",\n    \"title\": \"Connection with nature\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"inclusion_of_nature\",\n      \"title\": \"Please indicate which of these seven diagrams below best describes your relationship with the natural environment. How interconnected are you with nature?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Inclusion of Nature in Self (INS): seven pairs of circles from separate (1) to fully overlapping (7).\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1 — separate\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"7 — fully overlapping\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eaf0f3;--card:#fff;--ink:#1c2328;--muted:#56626a;--accent:#1f5f7a;--line:#d0dbe1;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=number],textarea{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:240px}\ntextarea{max-width:none;min-height:70px}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.pic{background:#dfe6ea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.pic img{width:100%;max-height:min(50vh,480px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.seg.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));max-width:280px}\n.seg label{display:block;cursor:pointer;position:relative}\n.seg input,.tiles input,.ins input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}\n.seg span{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\n.seg input:checked+span{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.seg input:focus-visible+span{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}\n.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}\n.tiles label,.ins label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;cursor:pointer;position:relative;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:4px;background:#fff}\n.tiles img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;display:block}\n.tiles span{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.25;padding:4px 2px 2px;flex:1}\n.tiles label:has(input:checked),.ins label:has(input:checked){border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--accent)}\n.tiles label:has(input:focus-visible),.ins label:has(input:focus-visible){outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.ins{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:8px}\n.ins label{text-align:center;padding:6px}.ins svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.ins b{display:block;font-size:.95rem}\n.on{font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n@media (max-width:520px){.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Pictures: VR landscape model renders from Vassiljev, Bell, Balicka &amp; Amrita (2020), Sustainability 12:10656, Figures 6 and 8–16 (Source: Peeter Vassiljev), doi:10.3390/su122410656 (CC BY 4.0). Circle diagrams redrawn after Schultz (2001). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='blueacu2020:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, done={}, SPEC=null, TR=[], ITEMS=[], ORDER=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;app.oninput=hideErr;\n  }\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!done.intro)return intro();\n    if(!done.about)return about();\n    for(var k=0;k<ORDER.length;k++)if(!done[ORDER[k]])return design(ORDER[k],k);\n    if(!done.fav)return fav();\n    if(!done.ins)return ins();\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    var miss=TR.some(function(t){return !files[t.file];})||!files['beach_overview.jpg'];\n    if(miss){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder designs must hold beach_overview.jpg and the nine design pictures (cliff1.jpg … reed3.jpg).</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Design options for a waterside</h1><p>We are carrying out research into the design of small elements that might be constructed in the landscape next to waterbodies in order to improve the possibilities for people to get closer to the water for a variety of purposes.</p><p>We would like you to imagine that you live in a residence close to a water body which you can visit for recreation or leisure at any time. This is the shore near your home:</p><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Virtual model of the shore: sandy beach and coastal meadow\" src=\"'+esc(files['beach_overview.jpg'].url)+'\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">On the following pages you will be shown 9 different designs which might be constructed here in order to improve access to the water. Each picture is followed by a series of standard questions with response options on a rating scale of 1–5. For each picture we ask you to imagine that you are really in that landscape. The survey is anonymous and takes about 15 minutes.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Please confirm to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){done.intro=true;save('d',done);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function about(){\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('age').title)+'</b><input type=\"number\" name=\"age\" min=\"18\" max=\"110\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('sex').title)+'</b>'+q('sex').choices.map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"sex\" value=\"'+c.value+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>','Continue',function(){\n      var s=app.querySelector('input[name=age]').value.trim(),v=Number(s);\n      if(s===''||!(v>=18&&v<=110)||v%1)return err('Please enter your age in full years (18 or older).');\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=sex]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+q('sex').title);\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['age',v],['sex',Number(x.value)]],b,function(){done.about=true;save('d',done);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function design(id,k){\n    var t=TR.filter(function(x){return x.id===id;})[0],f=files[t.file];\n    var rows=ITEMS.filter(function(it){return it.scale;}).map(function(it,i){return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+(i+1)+'. '+esc(it.title)+'</b><div class=\"seg\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(it.title)+'\">'+[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+it.name+'\" value=\"'+v+'\"><span>'+v+'</span></label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = '+esc(it.low)+'</span><span style=\"text-align:right\">5 = '+esc(it.high)+'</span></div></div>';}).join('');\n    rows+='<div class=\"q\"><b>11. '+esc(ITEMS[10].title)+'</b><div class=\"seg two\" role=\"radiogroup\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q11_return_visit\" value=\"1\"><span>Yes</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q11_return_visit\" value=\"0\"><span>No</span></label></div></div>';\n    rows+='<div class=\"q\"><b>12. '+esc(ITEMS[11].title)+' <span class=\"on\">(optional)</span></b><textarea name=\"q12_comment\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea></div>';\n    page('<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Design '+(k+1)+' of '+ORDER.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*k/ORDER.length)+'%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Design option '+(k+1)+'\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink)\">'+esc(q('design_option').title)+'</p>'+rows+'</div>','Continue',function(){\n      var v={};for(var i=0;i<ITEMS.length;i++){var it=ITEMS[i];if(it.optional)continue;var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+it.name+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer question '+(i+1)+'.');v[it.name]=Number(x.value);}\n      var c=app.querySelector('textarea[name=q12_comment]').value.trim();if(c)v.q12_comment=c;\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n      SPSite.answer('design_option',v,{key:id,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}done[id]=true;save('d',done);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function tiles(name){\n    return '<div class=\"tiles\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(q(name).title)+'\">'+TR.map(function(t,i){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+name+'\" value=\"'+(i+1)+'\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"'+esc(files[t.file].url)+'\"><span>'+esc(t.label)+'</span></label>';}).join('')+'</div>';\n  }\n  function fav(){\n    page('<h1>Favourite designs</h1><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('most_favourite').title)+'</b>'+tiles('most_favourite')+'</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('least_favourite').title)+'</b>'+tiles('least_favourite')+'</div></div>','Continue',function(){\n      var a=app.querySelector('input[name=most_favourite]:checked'),z=app.querySelector('input[name=least_favourite]:checked');\n      if(!a)return err('Please choose your most favourite design.');if(!z)return err('Please choose your least favourite design.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['most_favourite',Number(a.value)],['least_favourite',Number(z.value)]],b,function(){done.fav=true;save('d',done);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function circles(k){\n    var gap=[110,92,76,60,40,22,0][k],cx1=70-gap/2,cx2=70+gap/2,r=34;\n    if(k===6)return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"'+r+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"40\" r=\"'+(r-2)+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Self Nature</text></svg>';\n    return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"'+cx1+'\" cy=\"40\" r=\"'+r+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"'+cx2+'\" cy=\"40\" r=\"'+r+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"'+(cx1-(gap>40?0:12))+'\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Self</text><text x=\"'+(cx2+(gap>40?0:12))+'\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nature</text></svg>';\n  }\n  function ins(){\n    var h='<div class=\"ins\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Connection with nature\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(function(n,k){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ins\" value=\"'+n+'\">'+circles(k)+'<b>'+n+'</b></label>';}).join('')+'</div>';\n    page('<h1>Connection with nature</h1><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q('inclusion_of_nature').title)+'</b>'+h+'</div></div>','Finish',function(){\n      var x=app.querySelector('input[name=ins]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please choose one diagram.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['inclusion_of_nature',Number(x.value)]],b,function(){done.ins=true;save('d',done);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you for your time!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The nine designs were modelled for a real shore at Kopli bay in Tallinn, Estonia, within the EU BlueHealth project: three for a steep cliff, three for a sandy beach and three for reed beds. In the original online survey of 252 Estonian residents, Beach 3 (sitting platforms on the sand) and Beach 1 (a boardwalk to an enclosed swimming platform) were by far the most favourite designs, while Beach 2, Cliff 1 and Reeds 1 and 2 were most often the least favourite. Younger people preferred Beach 1 most and older people increasingly preferred Beach 3. Beach 3 also had the highest scores for time spent and comfort, and Reed 3 made people feel closest to nature.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Vassiljev, P., Bell, S., Balicka, J., &amp; Amrita, U. A. A. (2020). Urban Blue Acupuncture: An Experiment on Preferences for Design Options Using Virtual Models. Sustainability 12:10656, doi:10.3390/su122410656.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')done.intro=false;else if(x==='design_option')ORDER.forEach(function(i){done[i]=false;});else if(x==='inclusion_of_nature')done.ins=false;else if(/favourite/.test(x))done.fav=false;else done.about=false;});save('d',done);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={type:e.type,title:g.title||e.title,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='design_option'){TR=e.trials;ITEMS=e.items;}});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('designs')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var ids=TR.map(function(t){return t.id;});\n    ORDER=load('order');if(!ORDER||ORDER.length!==ids.length||ids.some(function(i){return ORDER.indexOf(i)<0;})){ORDER=shuffle(ids);save('order',ORDER);}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};done=load('d')||{};\n    done.intro=a.consent===true;\n    done.about=a.age!=null&&a.sex!=null;\n    ids.forEach(function(i){done[i]=false;});\n    ((a.design_option&&a.design_option.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    done.fav=a.most_favourite!=null&&a.least_favourite!=null;\n    done.ins=a.inclusion_of_nature!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
